        "content": "The exact-answer checker rejected your final value. Recompute from the given problem, identify a meaningful correction to your prior answer, and explain a reusable lesson. Solve in your own first-person voice, using 150–400 tokens. Identify the given quantities and requested unknown, explain the actual reusable operations connecting them, and check the result against the problem. Do not pad with generic advice or invent observations. Finish with a separate line FINAL: followed by just the numeric answer.",
